      "text": "Seraphine projects a pure note, dealing (60/85/110/135/160 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage, increased against champions and monsters by the target's missing Health percentage up to (105/148.75/192.5/236.25/280 + (70% Ability Power)) damage below 25% Health.",
